# Copy to `.env` (which is gitignored) and edit. Docker Compose auto-loads `.env`.
# You won't need this until the multi-service lessons (24+), where services like
# Postgres read their config from environment variables. Never commit real secrets.

# Example values used by the multi-service / capstone stack (lessons 24 & 26):
POSTGRES_USER=app
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change-me
POSTGRES_DB=app
